      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T15:00:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. Unicast is playing\n2. Broadcast is started\n2. Listening mode is set to true to leave Sink Audio HAL Client callbacks listening for request of AF resume \n3. Handover is done Unicast -\u003e Broadcast\n4. Recorder is opened and start record button is pressed\n5. Audio HAL Client resume is called\n6. Native request to change group \"from\" invalid to pre-handover active group (unicast activation)\n7. Broadcast is paused\n8. Unicast is activated\n9. Recorder is paused/stopped\n10. Audio HAL Client suspend is called\n11. Native request to change group \"from\" some active to invalid (Unicast de-activation)\n12. Broadcast is resumed",
